			"Message": "refactor(Mountain): Simplify binary and product names\n\nRename the Mountain binary, library, and default-run targets from the verbose development profile name to simply \"Mountain\". This follows the project's PascalCase naming convention and removes the debug build artifact naming.\n\nIn tauri.conf.json, simplify the identifier from the lengthy development-specific string to \"land.editor.binary\" and the productName from the long debug name to \"Mountain\". Also remove the duplicate \"Binary/node\" entry from externalBin.\n\nThese changes clean up the build configuration for proper release builds while maintaining the same functionality.",
			"SHA": "db5f0f7bc58c4108ea4f51ec3ac0d30bb008def3"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-04-29T16:55:25Z",
			"File": [
